	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(80.0, 330.0, 440.0, 190.0)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">*Chapter 4. Corpus: move Content to Ignored so only Title is used. Test and Score: the data goes in the Data input, each learner in the Learner input; target class = category. Bag of Words starts with Count / (None) / (None); change it for 4B. Naive Bayes and Logistic Regression take about half a minute each. Confusion Matrix: select the Naive Bayes learner, then click a cell.*</text>
	</annotations>
